~ start
Danilo: [i]"Pasakay po, manong!"[/i]
=>< Choices
=> END

~ Choices
Danilo: ... [wait = 0.5]
- Bus Terminal => Bus_Terminal
- Rizal Park => Rizal_Park
- Cancel => END
=> END

~ Bus_Terminal
Danilo: This wasn’t in the plan... => Choices
=> END

~ Rizal_Park
do Hud.hide_objectives()
do to_rizal_park()
=> END

~ wendy_start
Danilo: Wen! Have you been here long?
Wendy: I just got here.
Wendy: I thought you’d be late again.
Danilo: I’m trying to live differently now. Let’s go find a seat.
do wendy_follow()
=> END

~ pick_table_1
Danilo: It’s dirty here, we can’t sit at this one.
do set_table_used("table_1")
=> END

~ pick_table_2
Danilo: This one’s taken. We can’t sit here.
do set_table_used("table_2")
=> END

~ pick_table_3
Danilo: The chair is broken, we can’t sit here.
do set_table_used("table_3")
=> END

~ pick_table_4
Danilo: Here, we can sit here.
do ObjectiveManager.complete_objective(3)
do set_table_used("table_4")
do wendy_unfollow()
=> END

~ table_conversation
Wendy: Wow,[wait=0.4] fifteen years already, huh?
Wendy: How have you been?[wait=0.4] Especially now...
Danilo: Ah,[wait=0.3] I’m okay...
Danilo: [wave]I just didn’t sleep well earlier.[/wave]
Danilo: Feels... heavy somehow.
Wendy: Maybe because of today.
Wendy: It’s heavy for me too.
Wendy: It’s been years.
Wendy: [speed=0.8]...
Wendy: [center]I really should lighten the mood.[/center]
Wendy: [center]I don’t want us remembering only the sad parts.[/center]
Wendy: Dan, remember when we were kids...
Wendy: How much we loved playing hide-and-seek.
Wendy: [wave]And then you...[/wave]
Wendy: You always made me hide with you even when you knew it was wrong.
Wendy: Maybe you just wanted an ally,[wait=0.3] or maybe you just wanted to see him lose.
Wendy: One time, you took forever to come out... Here I thought you went home.
Wendy: Turns out, you were hiding near the grass by the tree.
Wendy: I couldn’t find you because you were both lying there.
Wendy: [color=#808080](sigh)[/color]
Wendy: So many years... [wave]since we haven’t had [color=#8B0000][i]him[/i][/color] with us.[/wave]
Danilo: ...
Wendy: Danilo? [wait=1.0]
Danilo: ... ...
Wendy: Hey[fade], [wait=0.5]Danilo?[/fade]
do scene_2_done()
=> END
